WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.485 --> 00:00:03.152
(water running)

00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:19.454
(glass breaking)

00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:22.846
- I guess I don't need my glasses.

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:25.429
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.306 --> 00:00:32.635
- Something's different about you.

00:00:32.635 --> 00:00:33.623
You get a haircut?

00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:34.553
- No.

00:00:34.553 --> 00:00:35.386
- You shave?

00:00:35.386 --> 00:00:36.219
- No.

00:00:44.425 --> 00:00:47.230
(shrieking)

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.192
- I don't know.

00:00:48.192 --> 00:00:49.892
For some reason you just look

00:00:49.892 --> 00:00:50.725
better.

00:00:52.237 --> 00:00:54.769
- That didn't hurt my feelings.

00:00:54.769 --> 00:00:57.012
- So what can I get for you?

00:00:57.012 --> 00:01:00.679
- I'll start with the
corn monte, montesair,

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.216
and a water.

00:01:04.216 --> 00:01:06.476
- That says gratuity included.

00:01:06.476 --> 00:01:08.381
- Sounds delicious.

00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:09.881
- Teeth whitening?

00:01:11.016 --> 00:01:12.545
Got a new shirt?

00:01:12.545 --> 00:01:14.962
(soft music)

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.610
- I can't see.

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:20.286
No, I can't see.

00:01:22.498 --> 00:01:23.498
I can't see.

00:01:25.868 --> 00:01:27.272
- Finally found the right hiding spot

00:01:27.272 --> 00:01:29.587
for when Trump gets elected?

00:01:29.587 --> 00:01:32.007
- What, what is it, man?

00:01:32.007 --> 00:01:35.666
- Is Paul not wearing his glasses?

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.179
- You would notice that.

00:01:37.179 --> 00:01:39.123
- I love his clothes.

00:01:39.123 --> 00:01:41.540
(soft music)

